### **Authentication & Authorization**
- [ ] ✅ All order operations check `getCurrentUser()`
- [ ] ✅ Users can only access their own orders  
- [ ] ✅ Email jobs include proper user context
- [ ] ✅ QStash webhooks verify signatures
