- [ ] ✅ Order data validated before creating emails
- [ ] ✅ User permissions checked before status updates

### **Rate Limiting & Abuse Prevention**
```typescript
// Example rate limiting implementation
import { Ratelimit } from "@upstash/ratelimit";

const ratelimit = new Ratelimit({
  redis: redis,
  limiter: Ratelimit.slidingWindow(5, "1 m"), // 5 emails per minute
});

export async function checkEmailRateLimit(userId: string) {
  const { success } = await ratelimit.limit(userId);
  if (!success) {
    throw new Error("Email rate limit exceeded");
  }
}
```

### **Secure Email Content**
- [ ] ✅ Unsubscribe tokens are user-specific
- [ ] ✅ Email templates escape user input
- [ ] ✅ Links point to authenticated endpoints only
- [ ] ✅ Sensitive data not exposed in email content

